  "impact": {
    "memory": "Ordering stores O(page count) integer identities, one open PDF during export and no page pixmaps. Reuses one coordinator,24 visible cards,32-entry/6-MiB cache and bounded32 event queue. Two240-page fresh runs: home idle66.125MiB before vs67.17MiB after adding seventh tool; organize stage111.015MiB including preview, not export peak. A separate two-logical-core1000-page reverse export measured process peak working set51.13MiB including fixture creation; synthetic/headless, not scan or frozen peak.",
    "cpu_ui": "Page moves run on the existing worker with cancellation at each move; pointer motion coalesces16ms and drag pauses preview application/submission. Two-logical-core affinity test1000 pointer events max heartbeat gap33.3ms. Generic resource harness includes spawn/navigation max lateness579.18ms; this is not a blanket responsiveness certification. Layout and stop/retry cover100%/125%.",
    "disk_startup": "One staged PDF beside output is reopened to verify every page xref before exclusive publication. No startup scan; registry lazily creates organize. Long reverse orders may incur quadratic page-tree/list work. HDD cold frozen launch/scanned exports remain unmeasured.",
    "dependencies": "No new dependency/process: existing PyMuPDF moves page objects, shared SelectionPage worker/queue and ToolPage token/loader, standard pure ordering model. Export concurrency remains one. Hidden cache/request/grab/timers release through existing visibility lifecycle.",
    "output_quality": "No rasterization, DPI/pixel or quality reduction. Original xrefs retain text/content streams, annotations/widgets/direct link destinations; detailed TOC remaps to new slots. Unit tests verify all24 four-page permutations, editable fields and direct links, source aliases/collisions/disk failure and cancellation rollback. Native Poppler comparisons match original pages."
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Development Windows10 host; CPU affinity is not physical2-core/4-GiB/HDD or Windows11 certification",
    "Native move/save calls finish before cancellation; reverse orders may have quadratic CPU cost",
    "Warm240-page source preview benchmark is not scanned/frozen export peak or cold-HDD startup certification",
    "JavaScript referring to fixed page numbers and specialized PDF actions are retained without semantic rewriting; digital signatures/password PDFs unsupported"
  ],
